C LASSICAL M ECHANICS 473
with (plots) :
f :  (x, mu)  mu  x  (1 – x)
f :  (x, )    x  (1 – x)
N :  50 : j :  0 :
for i from 0 to 2000 do
mu :  2.0  .001  i;
x [0, i] :  0.5;
for n from 0 to N do
x [n  1, i] :  f (x [n, i], mu);
if n > 20 then
mm [j] :  mu;
xx [j] :  x [n  1, i];
j :  j  1;
end if
od:
od:
points :  seq ([mm [jn], xx [j]], j  0 … 60000) :
pointplot ({points}, symbolsize  1)
